296 0 obj <</Type /StructElem /S /P /P 781 0 R /ActualText (A Knowledge Cut-off Date: Training an LLM is both expensive and time-consuming . It takes several weeks, or even months, to train an LLM. The data that LLMs are trained on is therefore not always up to the current.) /Alt () /Pg 16 0 R /K [5 ] >> endobj
297 0 obj <</Type /StructElem /S /P /P 782 0 R /ActualText (Training dataset constraints: LLMs, as we already read, have been trained on large volumes of data sourced from a variety of sources including the open internet. The publicly available LLMs have not been trained on non-public information like internal company documents, customer information, product documents, etc.) /Alt () /Pg 16 0 R /K [6 ] >> endobj
