395 0 obj <</Type /StructElem /S /H1 /T (Q10.  Does RAG support realtime updates in LLM response?) /E (Q10.  Does RAG support realtime updates in LLM response?) /Alt () /Pg 28 0 R /K [0 ] >> endobj
396 0 obj <</Type /StructElem /S /Figure /P 208 0 R /Pg 28 0 R >> endobj
397 0 obj <</Type /StructElem /S /H2 /T (Yes, RAG allows models to access and incorporate the most recent information from external sources, enabling responses that reflect current data and events. These external sources can be third party APIs or even the internet. Imagine an application built for users seeking travel advice based on the weather forecast. An important component of this application is fetching the weather details for the users location. The system may use a third party API service which can responds with a locations weather details when provided with the location in the input. This weather information is then passed to the LLM to generate the advice.) /E (Yes, RAG allows models to access and incorporate the most recent information from external sources, enabling responses that reflect current data and events. These external sources can be third party APIs or even the internet. Imagine an application built for users seeking travel advice based on the weather forecast. An important component of this application is fetching the weather details for the users location. The system may use a third party API service which can responds with a locations weather details when provided with the location in the input. This weather information is then passed to the LLM to generate the advice.) /Alt () /Pg 28 0 R /K [3 ] >> endobj
